                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains all the raw and processed data related to the publication \"Magnetic Properties of a Non-Centrosymmetric Polymorph of FeCl3\" (<a href=\"URL\">https://doi.org/10.1039/d4ma00635f</a>). It contains magnetometry data, neutron powder diffraction data, and small angle neutron scattering data. The readme.txt file contains a detailed description of the contents of the data set and explains which figures in the article the data files correspond to."
                },
